<title>GERMANY: Deutsche MG ups Wella to overweight.</title>
<headline>Deutsche MG ups Wella to overweight.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said on Wednesday it had raised its recommendation for preference shares in German haircare and cosmetics company Wella AG to &quot;overweight&quot; from &quot;neutral.&quot;</p>
<p>Deutsche MG analyst Markus Rausch said in response to a Reuter enquiry that Wella had managed a turnaround in 1996. The company held an analysts' meeting after its annual results news conference on Tuesday.</p>
